# Check out text files with LF endings on every platform. The stack's files
# (shell scripts, YAML, Dockerfiles, nginx.conf) are consumed inside Linux
# containers, where a CR breaks them, and Git for Windows otherwise converts
# them to CRLF (core.autocrlf=true by default). The refresh copies this file
# into the skill's template, so generated stacks get the same rule.
* text=auto eol=lf
